SUMMARY:Designing Presence
DESCRIPTION:This one-day session introduces participants to the core principles of immersive storytelling by engaging them in hands-on\, creative exercises rooted in sensory design and emotional resonance. Participants will explore how non-linear narrative\, mood and emotion can be conveyed through spatial design &mdash\; without relying on characters or dialogue. This session empowers creatives to recognize and express their own artistic voice while learning how to shape experiences that evoke feeling through atmosphere\, texture and metaphor.
LOCATION:Idea Lab - Level 5
